sequenceDiagram
  actor L as Leader
  participant FE as ManageMembersModal
  participant I as ResourceAccessInterceptor
  participant C as WorkspaceController
  participant S as WorkspaceService
  participant W as WorkspaceRepository
  participant M as WorkspaceMemberRepository
  L->>FE: Choose new role
  FE->>I: PATCH /workspaces/{id}/members/{memberId}
  I->>I: requireWorkspace(manage), leader or admin
  I->>C: allowed
  C->>S: updateMember(ws, memberId, req, actor)
  S->>W: lockById(ws), SELECT FOR UPDATE
  S->>M: findWithUserByWorkspaceId(ws)
  S->>S: requireCoverageKept
  alt a covered role would be lost
    S-->>C: 400 would leave no active role
  else coverage kept
    S->>M: save(member)
    S-->>C: MemberResponse
    C-->>FE: 200 OK
  end
